  "Deal Wind damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Permanently increase all allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> when dealing Wind damage (based on Morgana's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus ATK at <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK). Morgana permanently inflicts double <link=\"s|300\"><u>[Windworn]</u></link> stacks.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Let me show you what real dancing is!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Wind damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Activate bonus effects when using this skill for the first time: Permanently increase targets' DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Morgana's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus DMG Taken at <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK) and inflict $5 permanent <link=\"s|300\"><u>[Windworn]</u></link> stack. When Morgana is present, after a new foe appears, immediately activate the bonus effects.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Start moving, can you keep up with my rhythm?</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Wind damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. Inflict targets' with $3 <link=\"s|300\"><u>[Windworn]</u></link> stacks. Morgana enters [Meowtor Charge] state. This skill can be boosted by spending <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link>, up to $4 times. The first boost spends $5 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link> to increase Phys damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> and Wind damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color>, then dispel $8 buff on targets. The second boost spends $9 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link> to increase Phys damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$10</color> and Wind damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$11</color>, then dispel $12 buffs on targets.\\n[Meowtor Charge]: Unlock special skill [Crash!], after using [Crash!], deal bonus Wind damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$13</color>/<color=#FFFC40>$14</color>/<color=#FFFC40>$15</color> of ATK based on the number of boosts. [Crash!] counts as a Persona skill. When [Meowtor Charge] is active, Morgana is unable to use other Persona skills.\\n[Crash!]: Deal Phys damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$16</color> of ATK. When landing a Critical, additionally increase Down Points damage to $17 and increase targets' Downed DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$19</color> for $18 turn (when taking Wind damage, double this Downed DMG Taken), then inflict $20 <link=\"s|300\"><u>[Windworn]</u></link> stacks. This skill can be boosted by spending <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link>, up to $21 times. The first boost spends $22 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link> to increase Phys damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$23</color> and Downed DMG Taken to <color=#FFFC40>$24</color>, then dispel $25 buff on targets. The second boost spends $26 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link> to increase Phys damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$27</color> and Downed DMG Taken to <color=#FFFC40>$28</color>, then dispel $29 buffs on targets.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Be mesmerized by my dance, feel the impact of my moves!</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Wind damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Increase their DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> and additionally increase their Wind DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>. Lasts for $4 turns. Restore all allies' HP by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> of Morgana's ATK + <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
