G Taken to <color=#FFFC40>$28</color>, then dispel $29 buffs on targets.": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $1 of ATK and Wind damage to all foes equal to $2 of ATK. Inflict targets' with $3 [Windworn] stacks. Morgana enters [Meowtor Charge] state. This skill can be boosted by spending [Rhapsodic Beat], up to $4 times. The first boost spends $5 [Rhapsodic Beat] to increase Phys damage multiplier to $6 and Wind damage multiplier to $7, then dispel $8 buff on targets. The second boost spends $9 [Rhapsodic Beat] to increase Phys damage multiplier to $10 and Wind damage multiplier to $11, then dispel $12 buffs on targets.\\n[Meowtor Charge]: Unlock special skill [Crash!], after using [Crash!], deal bonus Wind damage equal to $13/$14/$15 of ATK based on the number of boosts. [Crash!] counts as a Persona skill. When [Meowtor Charge] is active, Morgana is unable to use other Persona skills.": "",
